	linkml:slots <https://github.com/kaicreator-mm/applicability> , <https://github.com/kaicreator-mm/assumptions> , <https://github.com/kaicreator-mm/claim_type> , <https://github.com/kaicreator-mm/domain_node_refs> , <https://github.com/kaicreator-mm/id> , <https://github.com/kaicreator-mm/limitations> , <https://github.com/kaicreator-mm/review_status> , <https://github.com/kaicreator-mm/scope> , <https://github.com/kaicreator-mm/source_refs> , <https://github.com/kaicreator-mm/statement> , <https://github.com/kaicreator-mm/taxonomy_refs> .
